### Register an endpoint (secret is returned once)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/endpoints
Content-Type: application/json

{"url": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/hook", "event_types": ["order.*"]}

### Publish an event (safe to retry thanks to Idempotency-Key)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/events
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-42-paid

{"type": "order.paid", "data": {"order_id": 42, "amount_cents": 1999}}
